      "cells": [
        {
          "row": 1,
          "col": 1,
          "html": "List of IP/IPv6 prefixes from which the service is accessible. When this parameter is set, packets are not dropped at the network level, but access to the service is denied for sources not matching the specified addresses. This option is best suited for restricting access within trusted networks. <br/> To block access from external or untrusted networks, we recommend using a Firewall instead."
        }
      ]
